stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> Pending : Order created after confirmed checkout

    state "Chờ xác nhận (Pending Confirmation)" as Pending
    state "Đang lấy món (Ready for Pickup)" as Ready
    state "Đang giao (Delivering)" as Delivering
    state "Hoàn thành (Completed)" as Completed

    Pending --> Ready : Restaurant selects "Làm xong"

    note right of Pending
        Exact intermediate confirmation semantics:
        NOT EVIDENCED / REQUIRES CLARIFICATION
    end note

    Ready --> Delivering : Shipper collects order

    note right of Ready
        Shipper acceptance eligibility:
        - Order is unassigned (BR-SHIP-02)
        - Shipper eligibility also applies (BR-SHIP-01)

        "Active delivery" state / attribute derivation:
        NOT EVIDENCED / REQUIRES CLARIFICATION
    end note

    Delivering --> Completed : Shipper completes delivery

    note right of Delivering
        Assignment cancellation after delivery has started:
        assignment is cleared and order returns to delivery pool.

        Exact post-cancellation Order.Status transition:
        NOT EVIDENCED / REQUIRES CLARIFICATION
    end note

    note right of Completed
        Review permitted after Completed (BR-ORDER-01)
    end note

    Completed --> [*]
